    {
      "text": "City staff report for the Nov. 18, 2026 Planning Commission: after the Aug. 25, 2026 Council motion to overrule the appeal failed and no other motion was made, the June 17, 2026 Development Review Hearing approval of the Architectural Review permit remained in effect. The City Council is the final authority on the tentative map.",
