    {
      "text": "Silicon Valley Voice reports five Council members voting on Aug. 25, 2026 (Cox absent, Mayor Gillmor recused); Chahal opposed the motion and Park abstained, so it fell short of four votes. The article spells the owner's name Damien Spino; the city staff report spells it Damien Speno.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003955",
        "SRC-003952"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Three buildings: an eight-unit 20,672 sq ft building, a six-unit 15,323 sq ft building, and a two-unit 6,012 sq ft building with two ADUs and 715 sq ft of commercial space. Townhomes are about 2,048 to 2,130 sq ft with tandem two-car garages; heights 44 ft (density bonus waiver from 40 ft) and about 35 ft. Exempt from CEQA under Public Resources Code 21080.66 (AB 130). Density 26.2 units per acre.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003953",
        "SRC-003952",
